        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. If an employee on approved Pregnancy Disability Leave is also eligible for leave under the federal Family and Medical Leave Act, up to twelve (12) workweeks of such leave shall run concurrently. Upon termination of Pregnancy Disability Leave that runs concurrently with federal Family and Medical Leave, an employee shall also be entitled to up to twelve (12) workweeks of State Family Care and Medical Leave for any covered reason except leave for pregnancy or a pregnancy-related medical condition provided the employee has not exhausted her FMLA/CFRA leave entitlement for that leave year.",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                97,
                1121,
                350
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 0,
            "block_polygon_points": [
