                    252.0,
                    874.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. Pregnancy Disability Leave may consist of leave without pay; however, an employee shall be required to use accrued sick leave in accordance with the University's Disability Plan. If accrued sick leave is exhausted, an eligible employee may elect to use accrued vacation prior to taking medical leave without pay, but not to exceed a total medical absence from work of six months. In the event that the employee's accrued sick leave is greater than six (6) months, a medical leave of absence without pay, in addition to the use of all accrued sick leave, shall not be granted.",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                897,
                1121,
                1124
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
