                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. If an extension to a medical leave of absence within the total six-month period or if a personal leave of absence after six (6) months is not granted, an employee may be medically separated in accordance with Article 17 - Medical Separation of this Agreement.",
