        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. An employee who has been granted a medical leave of absence for pregnancy/childbearing disability purposes shall be returned to the same job provided the employee returns to work immediately upon termination of the pregnancy-related/childbearing disability and provided such return is within four (4) months of the date on which the pregnancy-related/childbearing medical leave commenced.",
